<title>UK: Aluminium output rose in October - IPAI.</title>
<headline>Aluminium output rose in October - IPAI.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daily average primary aluminium output in October rose to 51,100 tonnes compared with 50,800 in September and 47,300 in October 1995, provisional figures from the International Primary Aluminium Institute (IPAI) show.</p>
<p>Total production in October (31 days) was 1.585 million tonnes, compared with 1.525 million in September (30 days) and 1.466 million in October 1995.  </p>
<p>The regional breakdown of primary aluminium production was as follows (in thousands of tonnes) the IPAI said.</p>
<p>				Oct 96   Sep 96   Oct 95</p>
<p>    Africa		    93	 89	 60</p>
<p>    North America	  499	479	448</p>
<p>    Latin America	  179	172	178</p>
<p>    East/South Asia	138	130	140</p>
<p>    Europe West	    270	261	n/a</p>
<p>    Europe East/Central  263	255	n/a</p>
<p>    Oceania		  143	139	134</p>
</text>
